/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 432 0 R
/ActualText (Finding a parking spot is one of the most aggravating issues for drivers. Particularly in public venues such as shopping malls, 5-star hotels, and multiplex cinema halls. They concentrate on practical smart parking technologies developed to address existing issues through the use of a wireless sensor network and real-time data processing from the sensors.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
