/ActualText (Predictive analysis using ARIMA \(AutoRegressive Integrated Moving Average\) is typically applied to time series data to forecast future values based on past trends. ARIMA to predict future parking slot availability based on historical data such as the number of available parking slots over time. And the available slots over the time using a mobile application)
