284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (To optimize parking availability, we are leveraging the ARIMA \(AutoRegressive Integrated Moving Average\) model for predictive analysis. ARIMA is a powerful statistical technique used for forecasting time series data. By analyzing historical data on parking slot occupancy \(e.g., the number of free and occupied slots over different times of the day, days of the week, etc.\), our model can identify patterns and trends to forecast future parking availability.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
